    "https://www.jobs.ac.uk/button/redir/button_id/31194": {
      "title": "This site uses cookies to store information on your computer.",
      "description": "Jobs in Further Education | College jobs at jobs.ac.uk This site uses cookies to store information on your computer. Some of these cookies are essential, while others help us to improve your experience by providing insights into how the site is being used. I Accept Cookies I Do Not Accept Cookies Necessary Cookies Necessary cookies enable core functionality such as page navigation and access to secure areas. The website cannot function properly without these cookies, and can only be disabled by changing your browser preferences. Analytical Cookies Analytical cookies help us to improve our website by collecting and reporting information on its usage. analytics On Off Marketing Cookies We use marketing cookies to help us improve the relevancy of advertising campaigns you receive. marketing On Off About this tool (Opens in a new window) Find a job Find PhDs Career Advice Jobs by Email Your Account Recruiters Careers in FE Working in FE Careers in FE The Further Education (FE) sector provides a range of career opportunities across multiple job sectors, including teaching, tutoring, administration, IT, human resources, and other professional and support roles in schools, colleges, and training providers. Not only does FE bridge the gap between secondary education and higher education, but it also offers the chance to contribute to lifelong learning for students, equipping them with the skills, knowledge, and qualifications they need to succeed in a wide range of careers. The FE job sector offers flexible study options for both young people and adults, with many career paths available in areas such as healthcare, construction, technology, and more. The same opportunities for growth and learning are available for employees. In this section, you can find the latest jobs in FE, including college jobs, as well as articles in our FE career advice section aimed at helping you find a job, working in FE, and managing your career. Explore working in FE Find out what it’s like to work in FE and career advice from CV and cover letter to managing your career. Find out more Latest jobs Closing jobs View all jobs Lecturer – Dance HRUC Location: Twickenham Salary: £4,178 – £5,827 actual salary per annum inclusive of London Weighting Date Placed: 03 Sep Closes 17 Sep Save Education Office Operations Officer (Maternity Cover) Education Office Imperial College London Location: London, Hybrid Salary: £48,246 – £58,318 per annum Date Placed: 02 Sep Closes 15 Sep Save Teacher of Media Derby College Group Location: Derby Salary: £29374 per annum: Non-qualified teacher; qualified teacher £32,922 to £44,218 per annum Date Placed: 01 Sep Closes 20 Sep Save Teacher of LEXIS – ESOL Derby College Group Location: Derby Salary: £29374 per annum: Non-qualified teacher ; qualified teacher £32,922 to £44,218 per annum Date Placed: 01 Sep Closes 13 Sep Save Teacher of Art & Design Derby College Group Location: Derby Salary: £29374 per annum: Non-qualified teacher ; qualified teacher £32,922 to £44,218 per annum Date Placed: 01 Sep Closes 13 Sep Save Executive Assistant Derby College Group Location: Derby Salary: Up to £36000 per annum (dependant on experience) Date Placed: 01 Sep Closes 13 Sep Save Lecturer – Supported Learning HRUC Location: Twickenham Salary: £33,429 – £46,618 per annum inclusive of London Weighting Date Placed: 01 Sep Closes 13 Sep Save Academy Manager – Health and Social Care Derby College Group Location: Derby Salary: £48313 per annum Date Placed: 27 Aug Closes 13 Sep Save Head of School – Sixth Form, English, Maths and ESOL HRUC Location: Twickenham Salary: £53,656 – £60,082 per annum inclusive of London Weighting Date Placed: 27 Aug Closes 13 Sep Save CEO Office Business Manager & Strategic Projects Lead HRUC Location: Harrow, Uxbridge Salary: £51,623 – £53,968 per annum including London Weighting Interviews are planned to take place on 22nd and/or 24th September Date Placed: 27 Aug Closes 09 Sep Save Lecturer – Education and Early Years (1 FTE) Morley College London Location: London, North Kensington Salary: £36893 per annum Date Placed: 20 Aug Closes 04 Sep Save Head of Quality and Compliance Derby College Group Location: Derby Salary: £55162 per annum Date Placed: 25 Aug Closes 06 Sep Save Course Team Leader – Travel and Tourism – 28.8 hours per week, 52 weeks per year HRUC Location: Uxbridge Salary: £32,438 – £38,351 Actual salary for 28.8 hours per week, 52 weeks per year Date Placed: 25 Aug Closes 06 Sep Save Head of Faculty – A Level Year 2 Nottingham College Location: Nottingham Salary: £45,458 – £49,150 per annum (Band 9) Date Placed: 19 Aug Closes 06 Sep Save CEO Office Business Manager & Strategic Projects Lead HRUC Location: Harrow, Uxbridge Salary: £51,623 – £53,968 per annum including London Weighting Interviews are planned to take place on 22nd and/or 24th September Date Placed: 27 Aug Closes 09 Sep Save Section Manager- Mechanical Engineering HRUC Location: Uxbridge Salary: £47,939 – £52,165 per annum including London Weighting Date Placed: 27 Aug Closes 10 Sep Save Lecturer – English – GCSE and Functional Skills HRUC Location: Harrow, Harrow on the Hill Salary: £33,429 – £46,618 per annum including London Weighting Date Placed: 27 Aug Closes 10 Sep Save Work Experience and Progression Mentor Derby College Group Location: Derby Salary: £27765 per annum Date Placed: 25 Aug Closes 13 Sep Save Head of School – Sixth Form, English, Maths and ESOL HRUC Location: Twickenham Salary: £53,656 – £60,082 per annum inclusive of London Weighting Date Placed: 27 Aug Closes 13 Sep Save Academy Manager – Health and Social Care Derby College Group Location: Derby Salary: £48313 per annum Date Placed: 27 Aug Closes 13 Sep Save Save Job × Please sign in or register for an account to save a job. Sign In Register Max Saved Jobs Reached × A maximum of 500 Saved Jobs can be created against your account. Please remove an existing Saved Job in order to add a new Saved Job. Manage Saved Jobs